Description: Nex Shortcut Manager (NSM) - Linux Desktop Shortcut Manager
 A powerful, responsive Qt6 desktop application to scan, create,
 edit, validate, pin and manage .desktop shortcuts on Linux.
 Features include:
  * Automatic scanning of system & user applications
  * One-click Add/Remove shortcuts from Desktop
  * In-place shortcut editing (Name, Exec, Icon, Categories)
  * Visual Icon Picker with search and custom icon files
  * File and Folder shortcut generator
  * Validator for Freedesktop Desktop Entry specifications
  * Pinned favorites and JSON Import/Export backup
